    Used: the examples of RFC 7515 appendix A.1 (the HMAC key), RFC 7516 appendix A, RFC 7518 appendix C,
    RFC 7519 §3.1, §6.1 and appendix A, RFC 7638 §3.1, RFC 7797 §4, RFC 8037 appendix A, RFC 9278 §3 and
    RFC 9964 appendix A, extracted from the texts by the tests (tests/common/vectors.rs, tests/protocol/jwt).
